Model avatars in this directory identify the model they belong to. They are cropped or lightly
edited from the model makers' own published artwork; the artwork and marks remain the property
of their respective owners and are used here only to identify each model. Orbita claims no rights
in them. If you own one of these images and want it removed or replaced, open an issue.

Rules for this directory: design-system/readme.md, "Iconography" (model avatars).
Each entry: file — models it is used for — source — what was changed. Retrieved 2026-10-24/25.

